This is the public RTpipeline software repository. It is never a manuscript
workspace.

The manuscript workflow's A2 entry check recognizes a workspace by CLAUDE.md
plus manuscript/, plan/ and step_prompts/, and then materializes a full private
scaffold. This checkout has repeatedly acquired that directory shape and been
scaffolded as a result. This marker makes the entry check skip it.

Manuscript text, figures, tables, source data, analysis code, review evidence,
and workflow files must never enter this repository. scripts/check_public_boundary.py
enforces that; run it before any release.
